    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I clean my room, and then I go jogging with my dog named (dog’s name).",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I run to and from the playground five times.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "After I finish jogging, I take a shower.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I often meet my friends and play around a little in the schoolyard before we go to class.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I have four morning classes that start before lunch time.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Each class is about forty-five minutes long.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I get up at six o’clock every morning.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "After breakfast, I brush my teeth, and I leave for school at about eight o’clock.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
